---
pagination:
  data: programs
  size: 1
  alias: school
permalink: "/seats/{{ school.id }}/index.html"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ school.shortName }}"
---
<article class="page-hero">
  <p class="kicker">{{ school.school }}</p>
  <h1>{{ school.shortName }}</h1>
  {% if school.name != school.shortName and school.name != school.school and school.name != school.school + " " + school.shortName %}
  <p>{{ school.name }}</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p class="lede">{{ school.sittingFrom }}</p>
</article>
<p>Colour on the map is a data swatch, not a partner mark.</p>
<p class="actions">
  <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/seats/">All seats</a>
  <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/map/">Map direction</a>
</p>
